{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dear Marie,\n\nVienna is quiet this evening. Without Fodor, Dardanelli, or Lablache, I felt the absence of their voices painfully. I went to the Leopoldstadt Theatre; it was an ordinary play, but I took the program with me to show you when I return.\n\nIn the afternoon, I visited Schönbrunn. The menagerie was already half closed. I only saw the elephant and the ostrich. The other animals had been withdrawn. It was too dark to make out the plants in the greenhouse. One cannot see many things here as they truly are because of the lack of light.\n\nThink of me while I sit in this cold hall. I will soon return to Berlin, where the warmth of our room awaits me. Kiss Karl and Immanuel for me.\n\nYour G. Hegel"}}],"created":1795221140,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":172,"prompt_tokens":260,"total_tokens":432,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-yz8bI2mc20iEO8tYweVP2IcNxc9eVFrS","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":260,"prompt_ms":466.964,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.7960153846153846,"prompt_per_second":556.7881035797192,"predicted_n":172,"predicted_ms":3979.41,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.27140350877193,"predicted_per_second":42.971194222259086}}